[WORK]
UID: WORK-SDOC-GRAMMAR-LANGUAGE-SWITCH
TITLE: The sdoc tree-sitter grammar switches the inner grammar on the language field
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
Extend the sdoc tree-sitter grammar (WORK-SDOC-TREE-SITTER-GRAMMAR) so that,
given a field embedding another language
(WORK-SDOC-EMBEDDED-LANGUAGE-FIELDS), it switches to that language's own
grammar for the embedded span instead of parsing it as sdoc content.
<<<
NOTES: >>>
Operator, 2026-09-02, verbatim: "extend sdoc treesitter grammar to support
switching lang grammar based on above"
<<<
